    "text": "For combustion of one mole of magnesium in an open container at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;bar pressure, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>601</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, the magnitude of change in internal energy for the reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kJ</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)<br />(Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "600",
  "solution": {
